s border with Ukraine so these  really aren't comparable in terms of  scale and this is very much a symbolic  move but nothing that really changes the  balance of force in this part of the  world  I think I just wanted to also gauge the  the atmosphere there briefly if you can  How concerned are ukrainians right now  well there's a bit of a kind of  Disconnect between the world's attention  on Ukraine and lots of ukrainians  seemingly going about their daily lives  without too much of a change but when  you when you talk to them they often  will tell you that they are slowly  coming up with plan B's you know taking  cash out in case uh issues happen with  the banks here they have to leave in a  hurry so there's a bit of a  schizophrenic sense of a desire to keep  on going but preparation increasingly  for the worst  all right Nick thank you DW's Nick  Connelly and Kiev
 

